{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/CityDefenceZ_Marketting-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1748524073\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build by Day, Survive by Night!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>City Defense Z</strong> offers a fresh opportunity to strategize with each sunrise, and a fierce battle for survival with each sunset. During the day, gather your resources, lay out your city, and merge buildings of the same type to construct stronger structures. <br>  <br>But be careful! When night falls, the zombies will come knocking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/2.gif?t=1748524073\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strategic Depth Meets Intense Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plan Your City</strong><br> Use every tile wisely to strengthen your defenses. Efficient space management is the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Merge &amp; Upgrade</strong><br> Combine similar buildings to create more advanced structures and gain valuable advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend Against Zombies</strong><br> As darkness descends, your city\u2019s defense will be put to the test. Deploy your units, set traps, and hold the line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/3.gif?t=1748524073\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Base Defense</strong><br> Protect the heart of your city to stay in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Management</strong><br> Make the most of your limited resources to expand and upgrade your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Building Merge Mechanic</strong><br> Merge over 20 types of buildings to create powerful and unique structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defense Strategy</strong><br> Position your units wisely, call in reinforcements, and fend off waves of the undead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</strong><br> Plan during the day, fight through the night. Each day brings new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Increasing Difficulty</strong><br> As your city grows, the zombie hordes will become larger and more dangerous. Are you ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/gif444.gif?t=1748524073\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Building Types</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Barracks</strong> \u2013 Produce defensive units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>House</strong> \u2013 Increases population capacity and supports more citizens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Factory</strong> \u2013 Generates resources to accelerate your development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farm</strong> \u2013 Produces food to feed your population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/gif444.gif?t=1748524073\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Prepare. Plan. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time is limited. Resources are scarce. And the threat only grows stronger.<br> The fate of your city lies in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2635500/extras/4.gif?t=1748524073\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Add City Defense Z to your wishlist now and prove your strength against the zomb